      "settings": {
        "heading": "THE COLLABORATION",
        "subheading": "",
        "text_content": "<p>Since 1931, Airstream has represented a spirit of adventure unlike any other. Its polished aluminium trailers have become some of the most recognizable design objects ever created, celebrated not only for where they go, but for how they are built. Defined by streamlined forms, enduring materials and a belief that the journey is as important as the destination, Airstream has inspired generations of explorers, designers, and travellers.<br/><br/>D1 Milano shares a similar approach to design. We believe that great objects should balance function and emotion, practicality and beauty. This collaboration brings those shared values together in a limited-edition watch that draws inspiration from nearly a century of movement, craftsmanship, and curiosity. Limited to 300 individually numbered pieces worldwide, D1 Milano x Airstream celebrates the enduring appeal of purposeful design and the freedom of the open road.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "enable_read_more": false,
        "read_more_text": "Show more",
        "show_less_text": "Show less",
