        "label": "",
        "heading": "THE WATCH",
        "text_content": "<p>The watch translates key elements of Airstream's design language into a wearable form. The brushed stainless steel case and integrated bracelet take inspiration from the iconic aluminium shell that has defined every Airstream for generations, while warm champagne accents reference the way light moves across polished metal surfaces throughout a journey.At the centre sits a silver sunray dial, chosen to echo the reflective qualities of aluminium while introducing depth and movement beneath the surface. The result is a watch that captures the visual character of an American design icon while remaining unmistakably D1 Milano. A compact, wearable interpretation of the materials, forms, and spirit that have defined Airstream for generations.</p>",
